        schema:measurementTechnique "99th-percentile low-passed (<= 3 q_c) spectral curvature of the L-BFGS-B relaxed mouse small-intestine columnar sheet (kappa_max=0.0805 um^-1, h0=28.90 um; in-sim sinusoidal estimate s_sin=3.1536) vs the same identity evaluated on the reference fold geometry (A=42.5 um, lambda=136.4 um, h0=28.9 um)" ;
